```js
async function fetchTahan(url, { masa = 8000, cuba = 3 } = {}) {
  let akhir;
  for (let i = 0; i < cuba; i++) {
    const ctl = new AbortController();
    const t = setTimeout(() => ctl.abort(), masa);
    try {
      const r = await fetch(url, { signal: ctl.signal });
      if (!r.ok) throw new Error(`HTTP ${r.status}`);
      return await r.json();
    } catch (e) {
      akhir = e;
      if (i < cuba - 1) await new Promise((s) => setTimeout(s, 1000 * 2 ** i));
    } finally { clearTimeout(t); }
  }
  throw akhir;
}
```
Timeout setiap cubaan (bukan keseluruhan!), backoff eksponen (1s/2s/4s), semak `ok` (4xx/5xx bukan kejayaan!), buang timer (`finally`). Tiga cubaan lalai, ralat akhir dibaling (pemanggil putuskan).

